+tutorial-touch-Move = Touch and drag on the left side of the screen to move. Drag on the right side to look around.
+tutorial-touch-Zoom = Pinch with two fingers to zoom the camera in and out.
+tutorial-touch-UseItem = Double-tap an item to use or equip it. Hold it to read its details.
