+tutorial-touch-FirstPerson = If you pinch the camera very close to your character, you can enter first person mode.
+tutorial-touch-OpenGlider = Jump, then tap the glider button (it appears where Jump was) to take to the skies!
+tutorial-touch-FallDamage = Ouch! Jump, then tap the glider button in the air instead of hurting yourself.
